    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Canary Islanders, called Isleños, began settling Delacroix between 1779 and 1783 under Spanish governor Bernardo de Gálvez.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Delacroix,_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The marshes around Delacroix have long supported booming fisheries, with Isleño fishers using small skiffs and nets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
