      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Delacroix,_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tour da Parish cycling race culminates at Delacroix’s 'The End of the World,' a popular finish spot.",
